{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1358676-what-are-tags","id":1358676,"title":"What are Tags?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-03T12:46:05-08:00","id":1358676,"title":"What are Tags?","content":"I just got Trinity core. It mentions in the super science section something about tags but I don't see then in the index or that section or in the table of contents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","name":"K9ine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12094_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T12:59:22-08:00","id":1358678,"title":"","content":"They are things like Weighted, Brutal, etc. you see on weapon stat blocks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T13:07:41-08:00","id":1358679,"title":"","content":"There are Armor and Vehicle tags too. <br /> Page 123 for Weapon Tags, 127 for Armor Tags and 128 for Vehicle Tags.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T13:11:45-08:00","id":1358682,"title":"","content":"More generally, a Tag is something that tweaks the standard rules for how something works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T13:51:00-08:00","id":1358691,"title":"","content":"Tags can even apply to some characters (such as Path Contacts).<br /> <br /> To expand a bit on what Dataweaver said:<br /> <br /> The role of Tags in the system is to allow for a large variety of options without a lot of mechanical text. Weapons are one of the easier examples here. Having a weapons (from your own fist, to a rocket launcher) is a mechanical permission to attack another character. But obviously just because all weapons serve the same purpose in that sense, doesn't mean they're all the same. So Weapon Tags let you create any weapon you'd want by combining different Tags to represent what different weapons do, rather than having large tables of different weapons (or small tables that don't feel like they cover as much as they should).<br /> <br /> Contacts are NPCs that stem from your Paths. Like weapons, they're not really defined individually, but rather Tags are used to indicate what areas they excel in. If your character is a lawyer, they might have a Contact that's a paralegal, and to represent their research expertise and knowledge base, you'd give them something like Studious as a Tag.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T13:55:30-08:00","id":1358692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1358676-what-are-tags?p=1358682#post1358682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More generally, a Tag is something that tweaks the standard rules for how something works.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are the basically conditions and tilts in CofD?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","name":"K9ine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12094_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T14:16:38-08:00","id":1358698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>K9ine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1358676-what-are-tags?p=1358692#post1358692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are the basically conditions and tilts in CofD?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not exactly, Conditions exist in Storypath, and they affect characters usually. Tags modify the item (or power in some cases) and s\u00f3 the results or restrictions of using it.<br /> <br /> for example, a weapon can cause damage as usual, or with the Incendiary tag, can cause fire damage, that ignores most Armors protection. Or a Armor with the environmental tag can grant advantage when exposed to high temperature or high gravity, while other Armors don\u2019t grant that.<br /> <br /> for vehicles for example tags define speed, size, cargo, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 01-03-2020, 05:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T14:58:27-08:00","id":1358709,"title":"","content":"If you want to compare Tags to something in the CofD, again, weapons are a simple comparison.<br /> <br /> If you look at the CofD weapon charts, each weapon has things like Damage, Initiative modifier, minimum Strength, Size, Availability, Range (for ranged weapons), Clip (also for ranged weapons), and Special (for things like two-handed, burst fire, 9-again, use with Brawl, etc.).<br /> <br /> That's all the stuff that Tags take over for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}